        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8820ME, Luzern Leverset with Wilshire 9\" Sideplate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Merrimack Lever with Wilshire Sideplate has an extra long rosette for added grandeur. The Merrimack Lever with 9 Inch Wilshire Sideplate has a traditional feel that will look stunning in historical homes. This Traditional Merrimack Door Leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Luzern Leverset with Wilshire 9 Inch Sideplate will fit most pre-drilled doors.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Luzern Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li> Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Classic Merrimack Lever with Wilshire Sideplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><b>Split Finish: Exterior Black, Interior French Antique</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a knob/lever operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Merrimack Lever with Wilshire Sideplate",
                "description": "The Merrimack Lever with Wilshire Sideplate has an extra long rosette for added grandeur. The Merrimack Lever with 9 Inch Wilshire Sideplate has a traditional feel that will look stunning in historical homes. This Traditional Merrimack Door Leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Luzern Leverset with Wilshire 7 Inch Sideplate will fit most pre-drilled doors.",
